Method Returns <code>priceHistory(symbol, tf, fromUnix, toUnix, maxBars=0)</code> <code>std::vector&lt;Bar&gt;</code> (UTC) <code>lastBars(symbol, tf, count)</code> newest N bars <pre><code>for (const Bar&amp; b : svc.lastBars("EURUSD", Timeframe::H1, 5))
    std::cout &lt;&lt; b.time &lt;&lt; "  O=" &lt;&lt; b.open &lt;&lt; " C=" &lt;&lt; b.close &lt;&lt; "\n";
