Method Returns <code>orderSend(OrderRequest)</code> <code>OrderResult</code> (check <code>.ok()</code> / <code>.retcode</code>) <code>orderModify(ticket, sl, tp, price=0, stopLimit=0)</code> <code>OrderResult</code> <code>orderClose(ticket, volume=0, slippage=10)</code> <code>OrderResult</code> (volume 0 = whole position) <code>openedOrders()</code> <code>OpenedOrders</code> <code>positions(magic=-1)</code> <code>std::vector&lt;Position&gt;</code> <code>positionsTotal()</code> <code>int</code> <code>openedOrdersTickets()</code> <code>OpenedTickets</code> <code>orderCheck(OrderRequest)</code> <code>OrderCheckResult</code> (dry run) <code>orderCalcMargin(symbol, orderType, volume, price)</code> <code>double</code> <code>orderCalcProfit(symbol, orderType, volume, openPrice, closePrice)</code> <code>double</code> <pre><code>OrderRequest q;
q.symbol = "EURUSD"; q.action = TradeAction::Buy; q.volume = 0.1;
q.stopLoss = 1.0800; q.takeProfit = 1.0900;
OrderResult r = svc.orderSend(q);
if (r.ok()) std::cout &lt;&lt; "opened #" &lt;&lt; r.order &lt;&lt; "\n";
else        std::cout &lt;&lt; "rejected: " &lt;&lt; r.retcode &lt;&lt; " " &lt;&lt; r.retcodeDescription &lt;&lt; "\n";
</code></pre>

Method Returns <code>calculateRequiredMargin(symbol, volume)</code> <code>double</code> <code>getMaxLotSize(symbol)</code> <code>double</code> <code>calculatePositionSize(symbol, riskPercent, stopLossPips)</code> <code>double</code> (lots for a % risk) <code>canOpenPosition(symbol, volume, std::string&amp; reason)</code> <code>bool</code> <code>calculateSLTP(symbol, direction, entryPrice, slPips, tpPips, double&amp; sl, double&amp; tp)</code> — <pre><code>double lots = sugar.calculatePositionSize("EURUSD", /*risk%*/ 1.0, /*stopPips*/ 50);
