</code></pre>

Field C++ setter / type Description <code>property_id</code> <code>set_property_id(pb::ACCOUNT_BALANCE)</code> — <code>AccountInfoDoublePropertyType</code> Which double property to read. <pre><code>pb::AccountInfoDoubleRequest r;
