Method Input enum Purpose Example values <code>accountInfoDouble</code> <code>AccountInfoDoublePropertyType</code> Select which double property <code>ACCOUNT_BALANCE</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_EQUITY</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_MARGIN_FREE</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_PROFIT</code> … (14 total) <code>accountInfoInteger</code> <code>AccountInfoIntegerPropertyType</code> Select which integer property <code>ACCOUNT_LOGIN</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_LEVERAGE</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_TRADE_ALLOWED</code> … (11 total) <code>accountInfoString</code> <code>AccountInfoStringPropertyType</code> Select which string property <code>ACCOUNT_NAME</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_SERVER</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_CURRENCY</code>, <code>ACCOUNT_COMPANY</code> (4 total) <pre><code>pb::AccountInfoDoubleRequest rd; rd.set_property_id(pb::ACCOUNT_BALANCE);
double bal = account.accountInfoDouble(rd).requested_value();

pb::AccountInfoIntegerRequest ri; ri.set_property_id(pb::ACCOUNT_LEVERAGE);
int64_t lev = account.accountInfoInteger(ri).requested_value();

pb::AccountInfoStringRequest rs; rs.set_property_id(pb::ACCOUNT_CURRENCY);
std::string ccy = account.accountInfoString(rs).requested_value();
</code></pre>

Method Output enum Accessor Values <code>accountSummary</code> <code>MrpcEnumAccountTradeMode</code> <code>account_trade_mode()</code> <code>MRPC_ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_DEMO</code> (0) / <code>CONTEST</code> (1) / <code>REAL</code> (2) <code>accountSummary</code> <code>MrpcEnumAccountMarginMode</code> <code>account_margin_mode()</code> <code>MRPC_ACCOUNT_MARGIN_MODE_RETAIL_NETTING</code> (0) / <code>EXCHANGE</code> (1) / <code>RETAIL_HEDGING</code> (2) <pre><code>pb::AccountSummaryData s = account.accountSummary();
switch (s.account_trade_mode()) {
    case pb::MRPC_ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_DEMO: std::puts("Demo account"); break;
    case pb::MRPC_ACCOUNT_TRADE_MODE_REAL: std::puts("Real account"); break;
    default: break;
}
</code></pre>

