Method Returns Description <code>getBalance()</code> <code>double</code> Account balance <code>getEquity()</code> <code>double</code> Equity (balance + floating P/L) <code>getMargin()</code> <code>double</code> Used margin <code>getFreeMargin()</code> <code>double</code> Free margin <code>getMarginLevel()</code> <code>double</code> Margin level, % <code>getProfit()</code> <code>double</code> Current floating profit <pre><code>std::printf("Bal %.2f | Eq %.2f | Free %.2f | Level %.1f%%\n",
            sugar.getBalance(), sugar.getEquity(), sugar.getFreeMargin(), sugar.getMarginLevel());
</code></pre>

Method Returns Description <code>getBid(symbol)</code> <code>double</code> Current bid <code>getAsk(symbol)</code> <code>double</code> Current ask <code>getSpread(symbol)</code> <code>double</code> <code>ask - bid</code> (price units) <code>getPriceInfo(symbol)</code> <code>PriceInfo</code> bid/ask/spread/time in one call <code>waitForPrice(symbol, targetBid, timeoutMs=10000)</code> <code>PriceInfo</code> Poll until bid ≥ target (0 = any tick); empty symbol on timeout <pre><code>struct PriceInfo { std::string symbol; double bid, ask, spread; int64_t time; };  // time = UTC seconds

PriceInfo p = sugar.getPriceInfo("EURUSD");
std::printf("%.5f / %.5f (spread %.5f)\n", p.bid, p.ask, p.spread);
</code></pre>

Method Returns Description <code>buyMarketWithSLTP(symbol, volume, sl, tp)</code> <code>uint64_t</code> Market BUY with absolute SL/TP <code>sellMarketWithSLTP(symbol, volume, sl, tp)</code> <code>uint64_t</code> Market SELL with absolute SL/TP <code>buyLimitWithSLTP(symbol, volume, price, sl, tp)</code> <code>uint64_t</code> Pending BUY LIMIT with SL/TP <code>sellLimitWithSLTP(symbol, volume, price, sl, tp)</code> <code>uint64_t</code> Pending SELL LIMIT with SL/TP <code>buyMarketWithPips(symbol, volume, slPips, tpPips)</code> <code>uint64_t</code> Market BUY, SL/TP as pip distances <code>sellMarketWithPips(symbol, volume, slPips, tpPips)</code> <code>uint64_t</code> Market SELL, SL/TP as pip distances <pre><code>// SL 20 pips, TP 40 pips from entry (rounded to digits for you)
uint64_t t = sugar.buyMarketWithPips("EURUSD", 0.01, 20, 40);
</code></pre>

Method Returns Description <code>closePosition(ticket)</code> <code>bool</code> Close a whole position <code>closePositionPartial(ticket, volume)</code> <code>bool</code> Partial close <code>closeAllPositions()</code> <code>int</code> Close every position; returns count closed <code>closeAllBySymbol(symbol)</code> <code>int</code> Close all positions on a symbol <code>modifyPositionSL(ticket, sl)</code> <code>bool</code> Set stop loss only <code>modifyPositionTP(ticket, tp)</code> <code>bool</code> Set take profit only <code>modifyPositionSLTP(ticket, sl, tp)</code> <code>bool</code> Set both SL and TP <pre><code>int closed = sugar.closeAllBySymbol("EURUSD");
std::printf("closed %d EURUSD position(s)\n", closed);
</code></pre>

Method Returns Description <code>getOpenPositions()</code> <code>std::vector&lt;Position&gt;</code> All open positions <code>getPositionsBySymbol(symbol)</code> <code>std::vector&lt;Position&gt;</code> Positions on one symbol <code>getPositionByTicket(ticket, found&amp;)</code> <code>Position</code> One position; <code>found=false</code> if none <code>hasOpenPosition(symbol)</code> <code>bool</code> Any position on the symbol? <code>countOpenPositions()</code> <code>int</code> Number of open positions <code>getTotalProfit()</code> <code>double</code> Summed floating profit <code>getProfitBySymbol(symbol)</code> <code>double</code> Floating profit on one symbol <pre><code>for (const Position&amp; p : sugar.getOpenPositions())
    std::printf("#%lld %s %.2f  P/L %.2f\n",
                (long long)p.ticket, p.symbol.c_str(), p.volume, p.profit);
